#### 封装聊天机器人
```python
class ChatBot:
    def __init__(self, client, model):
        self.client = client
        self.model = model
        self.messages = []

    def add_message(self, role, content):
        self.messages.append({
            "role": role,
            "content": content
        })

    def chat(self, prompt):
        self.add_message("user", prompt)
